# Keep the cheat PC controller PRIVATE: only the ios/ port gets published.
# Every other file (Android source, the controller.html JS, docs) stays local.
*
!*.gitignore
!ios/
!ios/**
!.github/
!.github/workflows/
!.github/workflows/build-ios.yml
!.github/workflows/*
!scripts/
!scripts/*

# CI lives at repo-root .github so GitHub Actions auto-detects it (workflow paths are root-relative: ios/...)
!/.github/
!/.github/**
